      "content": "As requested, I am being meticulous in highlighting all compliance gaps emerging with the Equitas-V2 model and its less stringent approach to handling \"edge cases.\" I will detail not only the granular checks we currently run but also quantify and qualify the severity and frequency of potential legal risks that could arise from the new operational parameters. Entry points for possible vulnerabilities have been mapped out. The final report will include actionable recommendations to mitigate these legal risks while transitioning. Will this suffice for the board?",
